# Relive the Past: "Return up to one target artifact card, up to one target land card, and up to one target non-Aura enchantment card from your graveyard to the
# battlefield. They are 5/5 Elemental creatures in addition to their other types." (CR 614.12, 205.1b, 613.4b). Bot1's graveyard holds a sacrificed Black Lotus, and a Forest and a
# Propaganda that Bot2's Chain of Smog made it discard; paying with that Lotus's mana and four Moxen, it returns all three: each is a 5/5 creature and an Elemental, still the
# artifact, land and enchantment it was (the Forest keeps its Forest type), from the moment it enters. Relive the Past ends in Bot1's graveyard.

